WEBVTT

00:00:09,650 --> 00:00:16,050
The spots where they remove the central lip nodes during my mastectomy surgery are still a bit sore.

00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:19,570
I've seen other women complain about this, so I guess it's common.

00:00:19,570 --> 00:00:27,490
Any suggestions? Well, you have wounds there, and you have lip vessels that are flowing to nowhere now,

00:00:27,490 --> 00:00:36,530
so it can cause swelling in that area. That's not uncommon, and it just takes time to heal that.

00:00:36,530 --> 00:00:41,730
So here when you literally had an organ removed, when you have your lip nodes removed.

00:00:43,250 --> 00:00:51,170
So there's not that really else you could really do. You could use some collendula lotion on it,

00:00:51,170 --> 00:00:57,570
or some comfrey lotion on it that might help be helpful and help it heal better.

00:00:58,450 --> 00:01:02,850
But no, there's just you got to give it some time.

